<title>ESTONIA: FOREKSPANK HIT BY CORRECTION.</title>
<headline>FOREKSPANK HIT BY CORRECTION.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forekspank was down by over five percent in early morning trade as a bourse correction bit harder into stock prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Forekspank fell from Monday's close of 237 kroons down to 220 kroons before firming slightly to 224/226 an hour after trading opened.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a correction in the price, but it is already starting to calm down,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is more speculative pressure this morning in Foreks than in Hansa and Hoiu, but the size of blocks traded are not very big,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>&quot;Some buying pressure is already about so it may hold at around this level,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
